'''Elementalist [[Canthan armor]]''' is an art type available in the Factions campaign as [[collector]] armor for the region of [[Kaineng City]] and as regular crafted armor.

The [[Prestige armor|prestige]] version of this armor is [[Elementalist Elite Canthan armor]].

